      "side": 1,
      "message": "I see, VisitDirectDeps would throw an error on modules that depend on a blueprint.Module.\n\nblueprint.Module dependencies are necessary for now, as that\u0027s\u0027 the only way to depend on Go code.  The com.android.support.apexer apex ships Go tools like soong_zip, and there are many genrules that depend on Go tools.  If we moved Go compilation into an android.Module then we could require android.Module not depend on blueprint.Module, but that\u0027s not currently planned.",
